Remove unused dependencies and restrict use of alloy. (#3907)
## Motivation

Machete is imprecise for finding unused dependencies. With the help of a
simple script more unused dependencies were found.
Also, the use of `alloy::primitives` poses some problems and was
eliminated when possible.

## Proposal

A specific program was designed for this search.

It is not particularly clever, but we had several missed stuff that
machete could not find and `cargo +nightly udeps` could not find as
well.

For the basic types, we want to avoid the use of `alloy::primitives` as
it a library with dependency on `c-kzg`. So, instead it was replaced by
`alloy_primitives` and `revm_primitives`.

